NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENSE
---------------------------
The Competition Factor player-rating system — including its rating engine,
update mechanics, component formulas, identity-resolution pipeline, and all
raw per-game component ratings — is proprietary and is NOT licensed by this
repository. The datasets here contain derived, binned representations
sufficient to reproduce the accompanying paper's analyses; they do not
contain and cannot reconstruct the underlying engine.

The example code in examples/ is provided under the same CC BY-NC 4.0 terms
for the purpose of verifying reproduction of the paper's results.

